de County","/arc-plc/missouri/laclede-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, November to December came in under 90% of normal in 38 of 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids in Laclede County. In 2025 that pair ran 37% of normal on the middle, and February to March ran 40%. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 171% of normal on the middle. Grid 20851 had its driest year in 1953 at 51% of normal.</p>"}
